:"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPdGV5dFRvWkNuTGJWWXVvUGVkNUZtNjdkbFRCZEVVM0tiWFdHS1AybzNvdVNrUTFfSExFN1FKLVVaMXVaamxGMUlROWk4bGotVDdMWHJvR2tWMlJCZmQ3YnBWa3Zjb3pla2ZMSlBTR0tZcG5ka3lvbFFZeGFud0VhVXMyZUtsMmhIUlQwc2ZYUldVb051?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"雅詩蘭黛公司 (EL) 在聘請倩碧行銷人員後是否已充分估值？"}],"order_news":[],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-19","period":"2026-06-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1001250/000100125026000041/el-20260630.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Est e Lauder Companies Inc., founded in 1946 by Est e and Joseph Lauder, is one of the world's leading manufacturers, marketers and sellers of quality skin care, makeup, fragrance and hair care products. We are a steward of over 20 luxury and prestige brands globally. Since the initial launch of the Est e Lauder brand in the United States, we have significantly expanded our consumer reach to approximately 150 countries and territories. We operate as a wholesaler, with our products sold in brick-and-mortar locations and on various e-commerce platforms, including those operated by department stores, duty-free retailers, specialty-multi retailers, online pure players, upscale perfumeries and pharmacies, and top-tier salons and spas. Additionally, we operate a direct-to-consumer business across freestanding stores, our brands' websites and third-party online platforms.","zh":"Est e Lauder Companies Inc. 由 Est e 和 Joseph Lauder 於 1946 年創立，是全球領先的優質護膚品、化妝品、香水和護髮產品製造商、行銷商和銷售商之一。我們是全球 20 多個奢侈品牌和知名品牌的管理者。自從雅詩蘭黛品牌在美國首次推出以來，我們已將消費者覆蓋範圍顯著擴大到約 150 個國家和地區。我們以批發商的身份經營，我們的產品在實體店和各種電子商務平台上銷售，包括百貨公司、免稅零售商、專業綜合零售商、在線純玩家、高檔香水店和藥店以及頂級沙龍和水療中心運營的平台。此外，我們也透過獨立商店、品牌網站和第三方線上平台經營直接面向消費者的業務。"},{"en":"In February 2025, we embarked on \"Beauty Reimagined,\" a strategic vision which focuses on accelerating best-in-class consumer coverage, creating transformative innovation, boosting consumer-facing investments, fueling sustainable growth through bold efficiencies and reimagining the way we work.","zh":"2025 年 2 月，我們開始實施「美麗重塑」策略願景，重點是加速一流的消費者覆蓋、創造變革性創新、促進面向消費者的投資、透過大膽的效率推動永續成長以及重新構想我們的工作方式。"},{"en":"As part of reimagining the way we work, we created our \"One ELC\" operating model, a scalable, integrated system designed to operate faster, execute with greater discipline, and drive growth. One ELC is built on three elements: One Team, One Culture, and One Operating Ecosystem. One Team is the simplification of the organization with fewer layers and silos, clearer ownership and faster decision making. One Culture is the reinforcement of how teams work every day, grounded in accountability, bold, entrepreneurial thinking, and agility. One Operating Ecosystem is the combination of shared platforms, data and strategic partners to enable consistent, scalable and effective execution across brands, regions and functions.","zh":"作為重新構想我們工作方式的一部分，我們創建了「One ELC」營運模式，這是一種可擴展的整合系統，旨在更快地運作、更嚴格地執行並推動成長。一個 ELC 建立在三個要素之上：一個團隊、一個文化、一個營運生態系統。一個團隊是組織的簡化，層級和孤島更少，所有權更清晰，決策速度更快。一種文化是對團隊日常工作方式的強化，其基礎是責任感、大膽的創業思維和敏捷性。一個營運生態系統是共享平台、數據和策略合作夥伴的組合，可實現跨品牌、地區和職能的一致、可擴展和有效的執行。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Skin Care - Our broad range of skin care products address various skin care needs. These products include moisturizers, serums, cleansers, toners, eye care, body care, exfoliators, acne and oil correctors, facial masks and sun care products.","zh":"皮膚護理 - 我們廣泛的皮膚護理產品可滿足各種皮膚護理需求。這些產品包括保濕霜、精華液、潔面乳、爽膚水、眼部護理品、身體護理品、去角質產品、痤瘡和控油產品、面膜和防曬產品。"},{"en":"Makeup - We offer an extensive array of makeup products across shades and colors. Our full array of makeup products includes foundations, powders, concealers and setting sprays, lipsticks, lip liners and lip glosses, and mascaras, eyeshadows and eyeliners. We also sell related items such as compacts, brushes and other makeup tools.","zh":"彩妝 - 我們提供各種色調和顏色的彩妝產品。我們的全系列化妝產品包括粉底、粉餅、遮瑕膏和定型噴霧、口紅、唇線筆和唇彩、睫毛膏、眼影和眼線筆。我們也銷售粉盒、刷子和其他化妝工具等相關商品。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our strategy is to build strong relationships globally with select retailers, and our senior management works with executives of our major retail accounts on a regular basis in support of these relationships. We believe we are viewed as an important supplier to these customers. In addition, we connect with our consumers directly through freestanding stores, e-commerce sites and social media to build a robust omnichannel experience that allows consumers to shop in these and other channels.","zh":"我們的策略是在全球範圍內與精選零售商建立牢固的關係，我們的高階管理層定期與我們主要零售客戶的高階主管合作，以支持這些關係。我們相信我們被視為這些客戶的重要供應商。此外，我們也透過獨立商店、電子商務網站和社群媒體直接與消費者聯繫，打造強大的全通路體驗，讓消費者能夠在這些管道和其他管道購物。"},{"en":"Our strategy to market and promote our products begins with our well-diversified portfolio of distinctive brands across four major product categories. Our portfolio can be deployed in multiple distribution channels, key travel corridors and geographies and we continue to expand consumer coverage by participating in high-growth markets, channels, price tiers and media where the strength, awareness and desirability of our brands provide a competitive advantage. Our marketing approach reflects a consumer engagement model designed to support the long-term equity and desirability of our brands while driving consumer discovery, engagement and conversion across markets and channels. By placing the consumer at the center of every engagement and leveraging our category, geographic and channel diversity, we are able to expand our consumer coverage and reach consumers across developed and emerging ","zh":"我們的產品行銷和推廣策略始於四大主要產品類別的多元化獨特品牌組合。我們的產品組合可以部署在多個分銷管道、主要旅遊走廊和地區，我們透過參與高成長市場、通路、價格層級和媒體，繼續擴大消費者覆蓋範圍，在這些市場、通路、價格層級和媒體中，我們品牌的實力、知名度和吸引力提供了競爭優勢。我們的行銷方法反映了消費者參與模型，旨在支持我們品牌的長期公平性和吸引力，同時推動跨市場和通路的消費者發現、參與和轉換。透過將消費者置於每次互動的中心，並利用我們的品類、地理和管道多樣性，我們能夠擴大消費者覆蓋範圍，接觸已開發和新興市場的消費者"}],"competition":[{"en":"There is significant competition within each market where our skin care, makeup, fragrance and hair care products are sold. Brand recognition, product quality and effectiveness, distribution channels, accessibility, and price point are some of the factors that impact consumers' choices among competing products and brands. There continues to be interest and awareness from our customers and consumers in responsibly-sourced ingredients and environmentally sustainable products, and we believe we are well-positioned to benefit from these preferences due to our social impact and sustainability efforts. Marketing, merchandising, in-store and online experiences and demonstrations, and new product innovations also have an impact on consumers' purchasing decisions.","zh":"我們銷售護膚品、化妝品、香水和護髮產品的每個市場都存在著激烈的競爭。品牌認知度、產品品質和有效性、分銷管道、可及性和價格點是影響消費者在競爭產品和品牌中進行選擇的一些因素。我們的客戶和消費者對負責任採購的成分和環境永續產品仍然感興趣並認識到，我們相信，由於我們的社會影響和永續發展努力，我們有能力從這些偏好中受益。行銷、推銷、店內和線上體驗和演示以及新產品創新也會對消費者的購買決策產生影響。"},{"en":"We compete against a number of global and local companies. Some of our competitors are large, well-known, multinational manufacturers and marketers of skin care, makeup, fragrance and hair care products, most of which market and sell their products under multiple brand names. Our competitors include L'Oreal S.A.; Unilever PLC; Procter & Gamble Co.; LVMH Mo t Hennessey Louis Vuitton SE; Chanel Limited; Beiersdorf AG; Shiseido Company, Limited; Coty Inc.; and Puig Brands, S.A. We also face competition from a number of independent brands (\"Indie Brands\"), some of which are backed by private-equity investors, as well as some retailers that have their own beauty brands. Certain of our competitors also have ownership interests in retailers that are customers of ours.","zh":"我们与许多全球和本地公司竞争。我們的一些競爭對手是大型、知名的跨國護膚、化妝品、香水和護髮產品製造商和行銷商，其中大多數以多個品牌行銷和銷售其產品。我們的競爭對手包括歐萊雅 (L'Oreal S.A.)；聯合利華公司；寶潔公司； LVMH Mo t Hennessey Louis Vuitton SE；香奈兒有限公司；拜爾斯道夫股份公司；資生堂有限公司；科蒂公司；我們也面臨來自許多獨立品牌（「獨立品牌」）的競爭，其中一些品牌得到私募股權投資者的支持零售商的一些擁有投資者的美容品牌。我們的某些競爭對手也擁有我們客戶零售商的所有權權益。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Other Countries","val":7370000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"CN","val":3930000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"US","val":3749000000,"zh":"美國"}],"total":15049000000}},"peers":["ULTA","ELF","STZ","DHR","DG"]}}